pan><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code><code>)</code></span> is undefined behavior.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Primary name <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/text/text_encoding#name\">name_</a></i></code> that is represented by a null-terminated byte string.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"text","title":"Text processing library"},{"path":"text/text_encoding","title":"std::text_encoding"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::text_encoding::name","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++26. Returns the primary name of *this. Equivalent to return name_;."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Primary name name_ that is represented by a null-terminated byte string."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++26"],"wordCount":57,"codeBlockCount":0}
